271
00:20:40,312 --> 00:20:41,939
Right?

272
00:20:42,606 --> 00:20:45,901
My best friend!

273
00:22:16,783 --> 00:22:18,410
-Juju Stroll!
-Juju Stroll!

274
00:22:18,493 --> 00:22:22,664
QUESTION
WHAT KIND OF PERSON DO YOU LIKE?

275
00:22:23,415 --> 00:22:26,501
Someone that's at least stronger than me.

276
00:22:27,002 --> 00:22:28,170
