280
00:22:40,348 --> 00:22:42,100
He has a great body.

281
00:22:42,184 --> 00:22:48,023
Well, it's normal to like handsome guys.

282
00:22:48,899 --> 00:22:51,818
I mean it's fun to be
with someone like him.

283
00:22:51,902 --> 00:22:55,447
But more importantly,
he has to make me feel that

284
00:22:55,530 --> 00:22:58,575
he's the only one for me!

285
00:22:59,701 --> 00:23:00,535
What?

286
00:23:00,619 --> 00:23:03,663
