290
00:23:10,545 --> 00:23:11,880
Well…

291
00:23:11,963 --> 00:23:13,381
You know…

292
00:23:13,465 --> 00:23:15,467
That one who looks nice.

293
00:23:15,550 --> 00:23:18,095
The one with the unique bangs. Come on.

294
00:23:18,178 --> 00:23:19,429
You know, right?

295
00:23:21,056 --> 00:23:24,392
Someone who looks nice…

296
00:23:41,326 --> 00:23:43,036
Oh, Miwa?

297
